1
00:00:00,158 --> 00:00:07,215
Part 25 teen hisson mein: pehle subscription aur plans, phir English se Hindi interface,

2
00:00:07,215 --> 00:00:14,914
aur aakhir mein ek poora business din, purchase se lekar delivery aur collection tak, bina ruke.

3
00:00:15,868 --> 00:00:18,330
Pehla hissa: subscription.

4
00:00:18,330 --> 00:00:21,454
System mein Subscription kholiye.

5
00:00:21,454 --> 00:00:28,555
Hamara account Free trial par hai, Professional plan ke saath, 7 din baaki.

6
00:00:28,555 --> 00:00:31,680
Trial mein har feature khula hai.

7
00:00:32,383 --> 00:00:37,502
What your plan includes mein chemist portal, salesman field app,

8
00:00:37,502 --> 00:00:44,060
mobile picking aur dispatch, business intelligence, aur kai godowns aur transfers.

9
00:00:44,060 --> 00:00:48,939
Saath mein godowns, users aur chemists ki ginti ki seema bhi.

10
00:00:49,621 --> 00:00:53,460
Plan aur keemat website par hain.

11
00:00:53,460 --> 00:01:00,790
Standard 2,499 rupaye mahina: ek godown, 8 users, 300 chemists.

12
00:01:00,790 --> 00:01:09,283
Professional 4,999 rupaye: teen godown, 25 users, 2,000 chemists, portal,

13
00:01:09,283 --> 00:01:13,471
field app aur business intelligence.

14
00:01:13,471 --> 00:01:21,033
Enterprise 9,999 rupaye: bees godown, 150 users, 20,000 chemists.

15
00:01:21,750 --> 00:01:24,410
Trial 7 din ka hai, bina card ke.

16
00:01:24,410 --> 00:01:31,665
Plans apne-aap renew nahi hote, kabhi bhi cancel kar sakte hain, aur data wahin rehta hai.

17
00:01:31,665 --> 00:01:36,018
Website par likha hai ki in keemat par GST nahi lagta.

18
00:01:36,018 --> 00:01:39,242
Is demo mein koi payment nahi kiya gaya.

19
00:01:39,931 --> 00:01:41,883
Doosra hissa: bhasha.

20
00:01:41,883 --> 00:01:44,856
Upar EN aur Hindi ka toggle hai.

21
00:01:44,856 --> 00:01:53,127
Hindi dabaate hi poora interface Hindi mein badal jaata hai: menu, buttons, aur headings.

22
00:01:53,830 --> 00:02:01,113
Dashboard par dekhiye: aaj ki bikri, mahine ki bikri, vasooli aur bakaya, sab Hindi mein.

23
00:02:01,113 --> 00:02:06,923
Orders, invoice aur credit jaise vyaapaar ke shabd bhi Hindi mein hain,

24
00:02:06,923 --> 00:02:11,178
par product ke naam aur numbers waise hi rehte hain.

25
00:02:11,852 --> 00:02:15,141
Har user apni bhasha khud chun sakta hai.

26
00:02:15,141 --> 00:02:21,881
Owner Hindi mein kaam kare aur accountant English mein, dono ke liye data ek hi hai.

27
00:02:21,881 --> 00:02:24,448
Wapas English mein badalte hain.

28
00:02:25,120 --> 00:02:28,299
Teesra hissa: ek poora business din.

29
00:02:28,299 --> 00:02:35,274
Subah owner login karke dashboard dekhta hai: bikri, bakaya aur order pipeline.

30
00:02:35,274 --> 00:02:43,044
Phir credit control mein top outstanding chemists, aur expiry desk par near-expiry maal.

31
00:02:43,718 --> 00:02:51,780
Eastern Demo Super Stockist se Telmiva aur Glucocheck ka maal aaya, jiska PO pehle bheja tha.

32
00:02:51,780 --> 00:02:59,841
Receive goods mein PO chuniye, batch aur expiry bhariye, printed total daaliye, aur Post GRN.

33
00:02:59,841 --> 00:03:02,962
Stock aur supplier ka hisaab update.

34
00:03:04,232 --> 00:03:12,142
Dopahar se pehle salesman Ravi City Care Chemists par order leta hai: Febrinil 650 ke 20

35
00:03:12,142 --> 00:03:14,300
packs aur Telmiva ke 10.

36
00:03:14,300 --> 00:03:17,356
Order seedha office pahunchta hai.

37
00:03:22,381 --> 00:03:25,080
Office mein order khulta hai.

38
00:03:25,080 --> 00:03:28,897
Credit check: City Care within limit hai.

39
00:03:28,897 --> 00:03:34,016
Febrinil par 10 plus 2 scheme se 4 packs free apne-aap.

40
00:03:34,016 --> 00:03:38,577
Approve dabaya, aur FEFO batches reserve ho gaye.

41
00:03:39,394 --> 00:03:43,568
Godown mein Rahul ke phone par pick list aa gayi.

42
00:03:43,568 --> 00:03:48,678
Rack aur batch dekh kar har line pick, phir 1 box mein pack.

43
00:03:52,861 --> 00:04:00,489
Office mein packed order se wholesale GST invoice: same state, toh CGST aur SGST.

44
00:04:00,489 --> 00:04:04,161
Invoice par free goods bhi chhape hain.

45
00:04:04,821 --> 00:04:12,200
Dispatch par City Care ka invoice chuna, Manoj ko delivery person banaya, trip plan kiya,

46
00:04:12,200 --> 00:04:13,361
aur van nikli.

47
00:04:18,863 --> 00:04:22,524
Shaam ko Manoj ne City Care par maal diya.

48
00:04:22,524 --> 00:04:27,927
Receiver ka naam likha aur chemist ne UPI se poore paise diye.

49
00:04:27,927 --> 00:04:31,675
Payment turant chemist ke khaate mein jama.

50
00:04:32,925 --> 00:04:39,652
Din ke ant mein owner dashboard dekhta hai: aaj ki bikri aur vasooli badh gayi.

51
00:04:39,652 --> 00:04:45,953
Collections report mein UPI receipt, aur City Care ka outstanding kam hua.

52
00:04:46,627 --> 00:04:52,666
Aakhir mein expiry risk aur credit ageing par ek nazar, taaki kal ka kaam tay ho.

53
00:04:52,666 --> 00:04:58,407
Yahi hai Medoro Distribution ka poora order to cash cycle, ek hi system mein.
